09159607,-0.00580955,-0.04054236,0.02159084,0.10202378,-0.03143695,0.02851919,-0.0851908,0.00873951,0.05749123,0.1693953,-0.04774155,0.01994864,0.04280447,-0.04368048,-0.0185935,0.0164665,0.0198523,0.04602685,0.00618642,0.05773957,0.01172343,0.05931976,0.03266561,-0.03627892,-0.03855128,0.00734399,0.00859965,0.01873964,-0.00581305,0.01413861,-0.02680342,0.10120916,0.03978528,-0.02080362,-0.05748179,0.01630528,0.01736798,-0.00607397,-0.01292383,-0.01249256,-0.0035675,0.02231592,0.02469621,0.01287824,-0.04103551,-0.0002414,-0.06557509,0.06003215,-0.01992569,-0.04509526,0.09625417,-0.09227656],"last_embed":{"hash":"af6pdf","tokens":406}}},"last_read":{"hash":"af6pdf","at":1774939540030},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1774939523337,"size":5389,"at":1774939536689,"hash":"af6pdf"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,18],"#Artificial intelligence & clinical nutrition: What the future might have in store":[20,42],"#Artificial intelligence & clinical nutrition: What the future might have in store#{1}":[21,25],"#Artificial intelligence & clinical nutrition: What the future might have in store#📝 Benim Notlarım":[26,28],"#Artificial intelligence & clinical nutrition: What the future might have in store#🟡 Genel Bilgiler (Sarı)":[29,31],"#Artificial intelligence & clinical nutrition: What the future might have in store#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)":[32,34],"#Artificial intelligence & clinical nutrition: What the future might have in store#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[35,37],"#Artificial intelligence & clinical nutrition: What the future might have in store#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[38,40],"#Artificial intelligence & clinical nutrition: What the future might have in store#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[39,40],"#Artificial intelligence & clinical nutrition: What the future might have in store#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42],"#Artificial intelligence & clinical nutrition: What the future might have in store#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)#{1}":[42,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/LKKWF3X7","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/4VZ8S2GL?page=1&annotation=VRT2CP46","line":39},{"title":"Sayfa 6","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/4VZ8S2GL?page=6&annotation=EKH7W644","line":39},{"title":"Sayfa 6","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/4VZ8S2GL?page=6&annotation=46QCIX5X","line":42},{"title":"Sayfa 6","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/4VZ8S2GL?page=6&annotation=7YBHT6T5","line":42},{"title":"Sayfa 6","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/4VZ8S2GL?page=6&annotation=EF2USQTW","line":42},{"title":"Sayfa 6","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/4VZ8S2GL?page=6&annotation=WIK3J4UU","line":42}],"metadata":{"Title":"Artificial intelligence & clinical nutrition: What the future might have in store","Authors":"Ashley Bond, Kevin Mccay, Simon Lal","Year":2023,"DOI":"10.1016/j.clnesp.2023.07.082","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"","Findings":"","Conclusions":"s. In conclusion, AI has the potential to transform clinical nutrition, but its integration into clinical practice should be carefully monitored to ensure patient safety and benefit.These findings would suggest a need for dedicated education and training program for AI within the medical and allied health professionals' curriculum.","Limitations":"There is a risk that AI systems can perpetuate existing biases and discrimination in healthcare. If the data used to train an AI model is biased or incomplete, the model will perpetuate the biases within the dataAs AI systems become more integrated into healthcare, questions about liability and accountability arise. Who is responsible if an AI system makes a wrong decision? AI experts, healthcare professionals, and regulators need to work together to develop clear guidelines and standards for liability and accountability in AI healthcare systems. While chat-bots and wearables can be used to support and monitor a patient's nutritional needs, the need for a trusting doctorepatient relationship will remain. Once “taught”, the machine can act autonomously and may do so in such a way that the users e i.e. humans - are no longer fully able to interpret or understand the manner by which it makes decisionsThere are key medical training considerations for AI use in healthcare. The first is the need to ensure that training of healthcare professionals in not replaced by AI. It is important to ensure that a healthcare professional's knowledge and understanding is notThe success of any AI development is, of course, fundamentally dependent on the human training the machine to deliver a specific outcome. Therefore, if an AI application is trained badly or with bad intention, then it will act badly with undesirable outcomes. The quality of the AI, and ultimately the impact it has upon care quality, is determined by the quality of the data input. Hence, there is a real need for healthcare professionals to understand and be able to participate in the development and application of AI","User_Notes":""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"af6pdf","at":1774939539870}},"smart_blocks:Augmented Dietitian Okunmuşlar/bondArtificialIntelligenceClinical2023a.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.07136974,-0.0253433,0.0139903,-0.0033321,0.0044934,-0.00889044,0.01039989,0.04972623,0.05475797,0.02869218,-0.02173203,-0.06605341,-0.02645673,0.0784042,0.04793562,0.00338072,-0.01313345,0.02997294,0.00446547,0.04699723,0.04813014,-0.0182476,-0.00354426,0.00002327,-0.04547964,0.02494613,-0.03734596,-0.05572648,-0.05056937,-0.17484258,0.01732054,-0.03310943,0.06534124,-0.01079527,-0.05528982,0.03379525,0.02221306,0.05552485,0.00729438,0.04974671,-0.00749302,-0.0417689,0.03653182,-0.01460423,0.02916083,0.0207355,-0.03429398,-0.01234565,-0.08222729,-0.01753181,-0.